{"seq":27,"slug":"insurance-economics","title":"保险经济学","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"保险经济学\">保险经济学</h1><p>保险经济学研究的核心问题是：当个体面对不确定性时，如何通过风险转移与池化机制实现福利改善，以及信息不对称如何扭曲这一过程。与金融风险管理侧重市场风险度量和对冲工具不同，本 hub 从微观经济学视角切入，聚焦保险合同本身的经济逻辑——为什么保险市场会失灵、精算师如何为风险定价、市场结构如何演化、监管为何不可或缺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>保险经济学与同属 economics-finance 的几个兄弟 hub 有明确的边界划分：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>金融风险管理</strong>（26_financial-risk-management）：侧重银行与资本市场的风险度量（VaR、ES）、对冲策略和 Basel 监管框架。本 hub 则关注保险合同层面的风险转移机制、精算定价方法和保险特有的偿付能力监管（Solvency II）。两者在巨灾建模和系统性风险分析处有交集。</li>\n<li><strong>博弈论</strong>（09_game-theory）：提供信号博弈、筛选机制、机制设计等分析工具。本 hub 运用这些工具来分析逆向选择下的合同菜单设计和道德风险下的激励相容约束。</li>\n<li><strong>行为经济学</strong>（08_behavioral-economics）：研究认知偏差与决策异常。本 hub 在讨论保险需求、风险感知和过度/不足投保时借鉴其前景理论与框架效应研究成果。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>对于有 3-7 年经验的开发者或具备基础经济学知识的学习者，建议按以下顺序推进：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基础篇</strong>（foundations）：从风险池化与保险需求出发，理解保险存在的经济学基础，然后深入逆向选择与道德风险这两个核心市场失灵。</li>\n<li><strong>定价篇</strong>（pricing）：掌握精算定价的数学框架，包括损失分布建模和再保险定价方法，这是理解保险公司运营逻辑的关键。</li>\n<li><strong>市场篇</strong>（markets）：了解保险市场的产业组织结构，以及 InsurTech 和参数保险等前沿创新如何重塑行业。</li>\n<li><strong>监管篇</strong>（regulation）：理解偿付能力资本监管、消费者保护制度，以及保险与系统性风险的关系。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>微观经济学基础：效用函数、期望效用理论、信息经济学基本概念</li>\n<li>概率论与统计学基础：概率分布、大数定律、中心极限定理</li>\n<li>对风险厌恶与不确定性决策有基本直觉</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"保险经济学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"risk-pooling-and-insurance-demand","title":"风险池化与保险需求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/foundations/risk-pooling-and-insurance-demand"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adverse-selection","title":"逆向选择与保险市场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/foundations/adverse-selection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"moral-hazard","title":"道德风险与激励设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/foundations/moral-hazard"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"pricing","title":"保险精算与定价","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/pricing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"actuarial-pricing-fundamentals","title":"精算定价基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/pricing/actuarial-pricing-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"loss-distribution-models","title":"损失分布模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/pricing/loss-distribution-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reinsurance-pricing","title":"再保险定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/pricing/reinsurance-pricing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"markets","title":"保险市场与创新","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/markets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"insurance-market-structure","title":"保险市场结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/markets/insurance-market-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"insurtech-digital-transformation","title":"保险科技与数字化转型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/markets/insurtech-digital-transformation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"parametric-climate-insurance","title":"参数保险与气候风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/markets/parametric-climate-insurance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"regulation","title":"保险监管与系统性风险","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/regulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"solvency-capital-regulation","title":"偿付能力与资本监管","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/regulation/solvency-capital-regulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"consumer-protection-regulation","title":"消费者保护监管","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/regulation/consumer-protection-regulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"insurance-and-systemic-risk","title":"保险与系统性风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/regulation/insurance-and-systemic-risk"}]}]}